  "prefLabel": "Pos 1502.01 Description of Recipient's Obligations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pos 1502.01 Description of Recipient's Obligations.\n\n(a) Recipients shall notify the commission of any change in the address shown on the application within 3 months of such change.\n\n(b) Applicant may reapply each year, for up to 5 years.\n\nSource. #9677, eff 3-13-10",
